#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Pagpapatakbo ng code {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr "Mag-click ng **Run** sa kahit anong code block. Ang unang click ay magsisimula ng Jupyter kernel sa pamamagitan ng [Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Pagkatapos noon, instant na ang mga pagpapatakbo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-09
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — On by default: code runs on AerSimulator or on noise-model FakeBackends you can pick in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode). Pages that need IBM Quantum hardware or IBM's cloud services say so when you run them.\n"
msgstr "**Simulator Mode (hindi kailangan ng account)** — Naka-on bilang default: pinapatakbo ang code sa AerSimulator o sa mga noise-model FakeBackends na maaari mong piliin sa [Settings](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode). Sinasabi ng mga pahinang nangangailangan ng IBM Quantum hardware o ng cloud services ng IBM kapag pinatakbo mo ang mga ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-injected on every run. [Create a free account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have one.\n"
msgstr "**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Ilagay ang iyong API token at CRN sa [Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) nang isang beses lamang — ang mga credentials ay awtomatikong ini-inject sa bawat pagpapatakbo. [Gumawa ng libreng account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) kung wala ka pang account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available na mga execution backend</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr "Bawat tutorial ay may mga executable code blocks. Mag-click ng **Run** upang magpatakbo gamit ang isa sa apat na backend:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr "**Binder** (default sa GitHub Pages) — Libreng remote Jupyter kernel sa pamamagitan ng [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"
msgstr "**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter sa iyong IBM Cloud account. Cold start sa loob ng ilang segundo sa halip na minuto. [I-set up](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr "**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Kumokonekta sa lokal na Jupyter server na may pre-installed na Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr "**Custom server** — Ituro sa kahit anong Jupyter endpoint sa [Settings](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from [Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr "Kapag may maraming backend na available, piliin kung alin ang gagamitin mula sa [Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Mga opsyon sa deployment</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "Ang doQumentation ay available bilang:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site na may [Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) para sa remote code execution\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Kumpletong stack sa lokal, maaaring mag-offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted sa Raspberry Pi na may lokal na Jupyter kernel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Magpatakbo nang lokal gamit ang Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr "Mag-install ng [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) o [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), pagkatapos ay magpatakbo ng:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr "Buksan ang [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — gumagana ang code execution nang lokal, walang paghihintay sa Binder.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr "Gumagamit ng Docker? Palitan lamang ang `podman` ng `docker` — pareho ang mga command. Ang mga image ay multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), kaya gumagana nang native (walang emulation) ang Apple Silicon Macs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-09
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "About & credits {#about-credits}"
msgstr "Tungkol sa amin at mga kredito {#about-credits}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's open-source content {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"
msgstr "Ang open-source na nilalaman ng IBM Quantum {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM provides a wealth of quantum computing learning material — all open source under CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"
msgstr "Nagbibigay ang IBM ng napakaraming quantum computing na materyales sa pag-aaral — lahat ay open source sa ilalim ng CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Structured courses from quantum basics to advanced topics\n"
msgstr "**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Mga nakaayos na kurso mula sa mga basic ng quantum hanggang sa mga advanced na paksa\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — 40+ tutorials on transpilation, error mitigation, and more\n"
msgstr "**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — 40+ na mga tutorial tungkol sa transpilation, error mitigation, at iba pa\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Guides and API reference for Qiskit\n"
msgstr "**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Mga gabay at API reference para sa Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — All content on GitHub\n"
msgstr "**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — Lahat ng nilalaman sa GitHub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Their [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) is always up-to-date and well-designed — the best place for reading, learning, and reference.\n"
msgstr "Ang kanilang [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) ay palaging napapanahon at magandang-disenyo — ang pinakamahusay na lugar para sa pagbabasa, pag-aaral, at reference.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What this project adds {#what-this-project-adds}"
msgstr "Ano ang idinadagdag ng proyektong ito {#what-this-project-adds}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM's [Qiskit documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) is open source (CC BY-SA 4.0), but their web application is not. doQumentation adds an open-source frontend with live code execution, automatic credential injection, and simulator mode.\n"
msgstr "Ang [Qiskit documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) ng IBM ay open source (CC BY-SA 4.0), ngunit ang kanilang web application ay hindi. Ang doQumentation ay nagdadagdag ng open-source na frontend na may live code execution, awtomatikong credential injection, at simulator mode.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployable anywhere — from [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) to [Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation) to [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). See [all features](/features).\n"
msgstr "Pwedeng i-deploy kahit saan — mula sa [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) hanggang sa [Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation) hanggang sa [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). Tingnan ang [lahat ng features](/features).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you're ready for more {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"
msgstr "Kapag handa ka na sa higit pa {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation helps you take your **first steps with Qiskit** — read, run code, and explore — without installing anything. As you progress, head to IBM's official platform:\n"
msgstr "Tinutulungan ka ng doQumentation na gawin ang iyong **unang mga hakbang sa Qiskit** — magbasa, magpatakbo ng code, at mag-explore — nang hindi kailangang mag-install ng anuman. Habang ikaw ay umuusad, pumunta sa opisyal na platform ng IBM:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Run on real hardware** — create a free [IBM Cloud account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) and an Open Plan instance to execute circuits on real quantum computers.\n"
msgstr "**Patakbuhin sa tunay na hardware** — gumawa ng libreng [IBM Cloud account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) at isang Open Plan instance para magpatakbo ng mga circuit sa tunay na quantum computers.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Latest content** — IBM's [Qiskit learning platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) has the newest courses, tutorials, and additions (some may not yet be in doQumentation).\n"
msgstr "**Pinakabagong nilalaman** — ang [Qiskit learning platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) ng IBM ay may pinakabagong mga kurso, tutorial, at karagdagan (maaaring may ilan na wala pa sa doQumentation).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Develop locally** — [install Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) on your own laptop for serious development work.\n"
msgstr "**Mag-develop nang lokal** — [i-install ang Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) sa sarili mong laptop para sa seryosong gawaing development.\n"

#. type: Plain text
